// The rooms of the game and where a new game starts.
// Each room is assets/rooms/<name>.room; doors inside the rooms join them.
// `pos` places a room's top-left tile on the world map, in tiles: rooms joined by a door
// sit side by side there, so the door's opening lines up on both sides.
